  "rule": "Reserved commands fire only on exact full-message match. Every scientific research trigger loads the interconnected research mesh and materializes INTERCONNECT_MANIFEST.json before Fusion 1, then loads the tool orchestration policy/router and records mandatory attempts or explicit quota/runtime fallback reasons. FRANK additionally treats the newest Clay research/architecture as its primary foundation. Every substantive visible response ends with STATUS_FOOTER_PROTOCOL.md and should be structure-checked when runtime execution is available."
}
